      "html": "<b>Apple Q4 earnings</b>",
      "when": "Thu \u00b7 2026-10-29",
      "kind": "calendar"
     }
    ],
    "note": "<b>Oktane is today and OKTA is held in both accounts.</b> The position goes in at <b>196.62, +0.69R</b>, 7.6% above the fill and 17.30% above the stop \u2014 the largest cushion in the book. What management has to show is whether AI security keeps growing as a share of bookings from the roughly <b>30%</b> it reached in the August quarter, and whether the re-rating that took Goldman from $126 to $203 has numbers behind it. Baird raised its target yesterday explicitly as an Oktane preview, so something is expected. The cushion means a disappointment costs gain rather than capital; there is no action available either way, because heat is at the cap."
